# =============================================================================
# Phase 0a: Soft potential SD minimization (cutoff=8.0A)
# Push all overlapping atoms to safe distances before real LJ.
# A=10000 provides moderate repulsive force (2*A/rc = 2500 at r=0).
# Using min_style sd (steepest descent) which is more robust for high-energy
# starting points than cg (cg line search fails when forces are extreme).
# =============================================================================
pair_style      soft 8.0
pair_coeff      * * 10000.0
neighbor        2.0 bin
neigh_modify    every 1 delay 0 check yes
min_style       sd
minimize        1.0e-8 1.0e-6 5000 5000
